+---
+id: task-001-fix-lower-case-sku-delivery-threshold-and-line-vat-rounding
+type: task
+title: "Fix lower-case SKU, delivery threshold, and line VAT rounding"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Request
+
+Three reports about the order service, this week:
+
+1. **Lower-case SKU refused (sales desk, Giulia).** Keying `lb-220` is refused with "no product with
+   SKU lb-220"; `LB-220` works. The README says SKUs are case-insensitive.
+2. **Free shipping not applied at €50.00 (customer, Marco).** A basket of exactly €50.00 after discount
+   was charged €4.90 delivery. The README says shipping is free when the goods come to €50.00 or more.
+3. **Line VAT one cent low (accounting).** A €1.99 item at the standard rate shows €0.43 VAT on its
+   line; the README (rounded half up to the cent, per line) gives €0.44.
+
+## Cause
+
+1. `Catalog.find` looked the SKU up as typed (`sku.trim()`), while products are stored under their
+   canonical upper-case SKU. It now uses `canonicalSku`, as `add` does.
+2. `shippingCost` tested `goods > FREE_SHIPPING_FROM_CENTS`, a strict comparison. It now uses `>=`.
+3. `lineVat` used `Math.floor`, which rounds down. 199 × 22% = 43.78 cents; it now uses `percentOf`,
+   which rounds half up.
+
+## Acceptance
+
+- `catalog.get('lb-220')` returns `LB-220`; an order keyed in lower case is placed.
+- Goods of exactly €50.00 ship free; €49.99 still pays the €4.90 band.
+- A €1.99 standard-rate line shows €0.44 VAT.
+- `npm test` passes: 14 existing tests unchanged, plus 3 regression tests (17 in all).
+
+## Scope
+
+Changes in `src/catalog.ts`, `src/shipping.ts`, `src/tax.ts`, and tests in `test/catalog.test.ts` and
+`test/orders.test.ts`. No change to pricing order, coupons, or stock.
+
+## Effect
+
+- Line VAT: only a line whose exact VAT ends in half a cent or more changes, and it goes up one cent.
+  Orders priced from now on use the corrected rule; orders already placed keep the amounts they carry.
+- Shipping: only goods of exactly €50.00 after discounts change, from €4.90 to free.
+
+<!-- end of task body -->
+
